docs {
  # POST /api/v1/ai/briefing

  Executive SITREP for the MBG dashboard, rendered in the Briefing panel.
  Uses the LiteLLM-backed engine when configured (`hasLiveAI()`), otherwise a
  deterministic scripted briefing built from the grounding context. Always
  cost/token-logged when live.

  **Source:** `apps/web/app/api/v1/ai/briefing/route.ts`
  **Auth:** none at the route, but the grounding context derives from dashboard data.

  ## Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "content": "## Ringkasan Eksekutif\n...\n## Insiden Utama\n- ...\n## Rekomendasi\n1. ...",
    "updated_at": "28 Mei, 22.10"
  }
  ```
  `content` is Markdown (## / ### / - / **bold**) rendered by the panel.
}
